   _Details                                    
;
According to the crystal structure of the kinase in the absence of CaM 
(J. Goldberg et al. (1996) Cell v.84:875-887), the residues Cys201 and Cys267 
are disulfide bound, while the others are free (C50, C179, & C213).  
However, this has not been confirmed independently for this complex.
;
